WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.245
On your phone, open Quick update.

2
00:00:02.245 --> 00:00:05.649
Tap Post a photo.

3
00:00:05.649 --> 00:00:08.778
Take a photo, or choose one from your phone.

4
00:00:08.778 --> 00:00:12.797
Add a few words. They
never show on the page.

5
00:00:12.797 --> 00:00:15.213
Choose Portfolio.

6
00:00:15.213 --> 00:00:19.841
Save it, then press
Publish on the Portfolio.
